Replace the placeholder plane-in-circle mark with the new Portava brand
icon on the sign-in screen, and update the brand name + tagline
(Portava — Explore. Connect. Belong.). Applied to the active
travel-buddy-standalone tree, the artifacts preview tree, and the root
app tree (tsx + compiled js) so every runnable copy shows the new brand.

Assets: assets/images/portava-icon.png (transparent-corner tile, 512px)
in each tree; full vector lockup at
travel-buddy-standalone/assets/images/portava-logo.svg for future use.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01FDCPzA4h43KpA5DDbC1MzP
