From: Draie <andraie.lewis@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 17 Jul 2026 03:33:08 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] Add show/hide password toggle to sign-in

Eye/EyeOff button (lucide) inside the password field toggles
secureTextEntry so users can check what they typed. Includes
accessibility role + label; applied to all app trees.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01FDCPzA4h43KpA5DDbC1MzP
